<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}
<p>Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your experience at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} Airport on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We always want your departure to go as smoothly as possible, so I’m sorry to learn that the flight status boards in the<strong><em> Qantas Club/Business/First Lounge</em></strong> weren't updated properly.<br />
<br />
We know the importance of accurate, clear departure information and would like to apologise for any stress this caused.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>-If querying why JQ departures in separate terminal not shown: -</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Jetstar’s departures</strong><br />
<br />
Eligible Qantas Frequent Flyers and Qantas Club members departing on Jetstar from a separate terminal are always welcome to use the Qantas lounges, but the separate locations and different departure control systems mean that we’re unable to provide up to date information on Jetstar’s departures.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that your comments have been passed on to the relevant team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you back to the <em><strong>Qantas Club/Business Lounge </strong></em>again soon.</p>
</body>
